        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "始终 + predicate",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "始终 says a condition persists from beginning to end of the relevant interval. It emphasizes continuity despite possible change.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "他始终没有放弃。",
                "pinyin": "tā shǐzhōng méiyǒu fàngqì 。",
                "meaning": "He never gave up throughout.",
                "audio": "83ca048a9ede9e92a862bbd86e69f6158c9a75a359c7e146d2baf50149f52a21"
              },
              {
                "text": "我始终相信你。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ shǐzhōng xiāngxìn nǐ 。",
                "meaning": "I have believed in you all along.",
                "audio": "b0ef9f872f352c43a20dd5b1936a7a6f19a9759aba1a41bce0171f0d4f7895f6"
